
Usage: /TPAGE <port> <message>
   Send  a  private  message  to  a user any where on the system.  Use
   /TWHO to find out which <port> the user is on.

   Example:
      /TPAGE TL0 Important! Please come to the teleconference.

   See Also:
      /TWHO

   Note:
      Only works on a DLG system.

